WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:07.665
Mika plugs in the power cable
and presses the button.

2
00:00:07.665 --> 00:00:11.369
The Core wakes and opens
its own Wi-Fi network.

3
00:00:11.843 --> 00:00:16.681
Elias opens the Wi-Fi settings on his
phone and joins the Core's own network.

4
00:00:16.681 --> 00:00:19.810
Then he chooses the home
network from the list.

5
00:00:20.303 --> 00:00:23.028
Mika messages the agent she named Odette.

6
00:00:23.028 --> 00:00:25.590
Odette answers, and the Core is running.

7
00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:29.256
<v Odette>Hello, Mika. I am Odette.
What should we do first?

8
00:00:29.804 --> 00:00:34.059
Friday is film night. Jellyfin streams
Mika's own collection of movies

9
00:00:34.059 --> 00:00:37.317
to the living-room TV,
straight from the Core.

10
00:00:37.843 --> 00:00:41.156
Elias and Mika share the
grocery list in KitchenOwl.

11
00:00:41.156 --> 00:00:44.919
Oat milk added at the counter
shows up on the other's phone.

12
00:00:45.456 --> 00:00:47.594
Mika scans a supplier invoice.

13
00:00:47.594 --> 00:00:53.280
Paperless-ngx reads every page, tags it
and files it, so a search finds it later.

14
00:00:53.806 --> 00:00:56.019
A new portrait enquiry arrives.

15
00:00:56.019 --> 00:01:00.744
Elias asks Marlo, and Marlo opens Twenty
in its own browser to add the lead.

16
00:01:00.744 --> 00:01:02.966
Elias checks every field.

17
00:01:02.966 --> 00:01:06.302
<v Marlo>Lead added. Please check the details.

18
00:01:06.786 --> 00:01:10.286
Photos, paperwork, lights,
cameras and two agents.

19
00:01:10.286 --> 00:01:15.014
The Vance-Takahashi household runs it all
from one Companion Core in the study.

20
00:01:15.816 --> 00:01:20.229
Your photos, your paperwork and your agents
can run on a Companion Core at home.

21
00:01:20.229 --> 00:01:23.466
Browse the Companion Hub store
and pick your first apps.

22
00:01:23.466 --> 00:01:25.395
UnCloud your life.
